    "body": "## What does this implement/fix?\n\n| Property | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Method | `setupWebView` |\n| Class | `uk.org.retallack.slimbook.MainActivity` |\n| File | `app/src/main/java/uk/org/retallack/slimbook/MainActivity.kt` |\n| Specification | `WebViewDebuggingSpec` |\n| Analysis tool | `static:manual` |\n\n## Summary\n\nGuard the existing debugging enablement with BuildConfig.DEBUG. This preserves debugging for debug builds while preventing release/non-debug builds from enabling WebView contents debugging.\n\n## How was this tested?\n\n- No automated test was added in this change\n- [x] Project compiles successfully (`assembleDebug`)\n- [ ] Confirmed by a project maintainer\n\n## Additional context\n\nI’m an undergraduate Computer Engineering student at the University of Brasília (UnB), and this contribution is part of a research project involving static analysis of Android apps.\n\nI’m happy to adjust the implementation to better match the project’s architecture, coding conventions, or maintainers’ recommendations.",
